# Signing secrets — App Store Connect API keys, distribution certs, profiles.
# Belt-and-braces: the mobile app has its own rules, this catches keys that
# land at the repo root straight out of a browser download.
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
*.jks
google-service-account.json

# Design mockups / scratch copies — not part of either app. Kept out of the repo
# so nobody handed the project builds from the wrong tree.
hasio v5/
ChatGPT Image *.png

# Pasted screenshots
*.jpg
!public/og-image.jpg
# Photo masters the shipped place cards are cropped from — losing these means
# the crop can never be redone, so they are tracked despite the blanket *.jpg
# rule. Deliberately this one folder, not design-assets/**: a wider exception
# also picks up the mockups sitting alongside it, which are disposable.
!design-assets/place-sources/*.jpg

# Stray Expo stub: the real app config is hasio-mobile-app/app.json
/app.json
/section.png
